@page "/what-we-build"

<PageTitle>What we build · louis-agent</PageTitle>
<PageHead Description="A website for your business with an AI agent in its corner that answers your customers day and night, and custom agents for bigger jobs, built and hosted in South Africa." />

<Band Id="top" Kicker="What we build">
    <BandTitle Class="chrome">A website that answers your customers.</BandTitle>
    <p class="lede">Your website, built and hosted for you, with an agent in its corner like the one in ours. It knows your business and answers your customers day and night, the way you would.</p>
    <div class="grid-3">
        <Tile Title="It knows your business">Your hours, your prices, your services and your story, from a few plain files. Change a file and it knows, no developer needed.</Tile>
        <Tile Title="It answers at ten at night" Delay="1">The questions you get every day, answered while you sleep, so a customer stays instead of trying the next place.</Tile>
        <Tile Title="It knows when to pass on" Delay="2">A practice's agent books and passes people on, and never gives advice. A booking or a complaint goes to the right person.</Tile>
    </div>
    <p class="band-note">Every answer is measured, so you see what it costs. <a href="/pricing">Two plans, from R500 a month</a>.</p>
</Band>

<Band Id="custom" Kicker="Custom agents">
    <h2 class="chrome">A bigger job? An agent of your own.</h2>
    <p class="lede">Describe the job and it becomes a custom agent: read these documents, check that report, match my invoices, tell someone when it's late. It reaches your own systems, a mailbox, a spreadsheet, an accounting package.</p>
    <div class="grid-2">
        <Tile Title="Where your data lives">It can run in a closed container in your own environment, or in Azure's South African region. The model is yours to pick, a hosted one or a local one.</Tile>
        <Tile Title="Checked before you see it" Delay="1">Every change is tested on your kind of work before it reaches you, and every answer it gives is measured.</Tile>
    </div>
</Band>

<Band Id="start" Kicker="How it starts">
    <h2 class="chrome">A short call, then something to look at.</h2>
    <p class="lede">A short call to pin down the one job it does first. Then a working agent on made-up data, so you see it before anything goes live. Then it's yours.</p>
    <p class="band-note">In Cape Town and surrounds, Stellenbosch, Paarl and the Winelands, Louis can come to you. <a href="/contact">Ask for yours</a>.</p>
</Band>
